{"code":"zh","name":"Chinese","native":"中文","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A1","pronunciation":[{"t":"Four tones change meaning: mā/má/mǎ/mà","r":"ma1/ma2/ma3/ma4","tip":"妈 (mum), 麻 (hemp), 马 (horse), 骂 (scold) — same MA, four words! Sing the tones!"},{"t":"j/q/x: tongue flat behind lower teeth","r":"ji/qi/xi","tip":"Smile wide! 鸡 (ji = chicken), 七 (qi = seven), 西 (xi = west). Never English J! "},{"t":"zh/ch/sh curl back, z/c/s stay flat","r":"zhi/chi/shi vs zi/ci/si","tip":"知 (zhī = know) curls; 子 (zǐ = child) stays flat. Two sets — train both!"},{"t":"ü rounds lips like French U","r":"ü","tip":"绿 (lǜ = green), 女 (nǚ = woman). Say EE with rounded lips!"},{"t":"Neutral tone goes light and quick","r":"ma (light)","tip":"妈妈 (māma) — second MA is light! 谢谢 (xièxie) — second Xie floats!"}],"alphabet":{"title":"Pinyin initials: your sound map","explain":"Chinese characters don't show sound — PINYIN (Roman letters) does! Master these 23 initials + 4 tones and you can pronounce ANYTHING. Characters come with every word — learn sound and shape together!","letters":[{"t":"b","r":"b (unaspirated p)"},{"t":"p","r":"p (puff of air)"},{"t":"m","r":"m"},{"t":"f","r":"f"},{"t":"d","r":"d (unaspirated t)"},{"t":"t","r":"t (puff of air)"},{"t":"n","r":"n"},{"t":"l","r":"l"},{"t":"g","r":"g (unaspirated k)"},{"t":"k","r":"k (puff of air)"},{"t":"h","r":"h (throaty)"},{"t":"j","r":"j (flat-tongue)"},{"t":"q","r":"q (flat + air)"},{"t":"x","r":"x (flat sh)"},{"t":"zh","r":"zh (curled j)"},{"t":"ch","r":"ch (curled + air)"},{"t":"sh","r":"sh (curled)"},{"t":"r","r":"r (curled zh-like)"},{"t":"z","r":"z (flat dz)"},{"t":"c","r":"c (flat ts + air)"},{"t":"s","r":"s"},{"t":"y","r":"y"},{"t":"w","r":"w"}]},"counting":{"title":"Counting 0 to 100","explain":"Simplest system ever! 1–10, then stack: 11 = 十一 (10-1), 20 = 二十 (2-10s), 21 = 二十一. 100 = 一百. Learn 10 words, count to 100!","numbers":[{"t":"零","r":"líng","en":"0"},{"t":"一","r":"yī","en":"1"},{"t":"二","r":"èr","en":"2"},{"t":"三","r":"sān","en":"3"},{"t":"四","r":"sì","en":"4"},{"t":"五","r":"wǔ","en":"5"},{"t":"六","r":"liù","en":"6"},{"t":"七","r":"qī","en":"7"},{"t":"八","r":"bā","en":"8"},{"t":"九","r":"jiǔ","en":"9"},{"t":"十","r":"shí","en":"10"},{"t":"十一","r":"shíyī","en":"11"},{"t":"十二","r":"shí'èr","en":"12"},{"t":"十三","r":"shísān","en":"13"},{"t":"十四","r":"shísì","en":"14"},{"t":"十五","r":"shíwǔ","en":"15"},{"t":"十六","r":"shíliù","en":"16"},{"t":"十七","r":"shíqī","en":"17"},{"t":"十八","r":"shíbā","en":"18"},{"t":"十九","r":"shíjiǔ","en":"19"},{"t":"二十","r":"èrshí","en":"20"},{"t":"三十","r":"sānshí","en":"30"},{"t":"四十","r":"sìshí","en":"40"},{"t":"五十","r":"wǔshí","en":"50"},{"t":"六十","r":"liùshí","en":"60"},{"t":"七十","r":"qīshí","en":"70"},{"t":"八十","r":"bāshí","en":"80"},{"t":"九十","r":"jiǔshí","en":"90"},{"t":"一百","r":"yìbǎi","en":"100"}],"rules":["11–19 = 十 + ones: 十一 = 11.","Tens = number + 十: 二十 = 20. 21 = 二十一 — pure stacking!"]},"level":{"title":"Starter: greetings, 是, first verbs","goals":["Greet people and introduce yourself","Use 是, 这/那 and measure words","Use verbs with no conjugation + 有"],"units":[{"id":"A1-U1","title":"First words","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U1-L1","title":"Greetings: 你好","learn":"你好 (hello), 您好 (polite hello). Meeting: 初次见面 (first meeting) → 我是 + name → 很高兴认识你 (happy to know you)! Nod warmly!","vocab":[{"t":"你好","r":"nǐ hǎo","en":"hello","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"您好","r":"nín hǎo","en":"hello (polite)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"早上好","r":"zǎo shang hǎo","en":"good morning","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"晚上好","r":"wǎn shang hǎo","en":"good evening","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"谢谢","r":"xiè xie","en":"thanks","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"对不起","r":"duì bu qǐ","en":"sorry","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"没关系","r":"méi guān xi","en":"no problem","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"再见","r":"zài jiàn","en":"goodbye","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"我是X + 很高兴认识你","explain":"我是小明 = I am Xiaoming. 是 = am/is/are (never changes!). 很高兴认识你 = very-happy-know-you!","pattern":"初次见面，我是 + name","examples":[{"t":"初次见面，我是小明。","r":"chū cì jiàn miàn, wǒ shì Xiǎo Míng.","en":"First meeting, I am Xiaoming."},{"t":"很高兴认识你!","r":"hěn gāo xìng rèn shi nǐ!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"t":"谢谢!","r":"xiè xie!","en":"Thanks!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 你好 to elders first — open with 您好!","Saying 我是是 — one 是 only!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"初次见面，我是小明。","r":"chū cì jiàn miàn, wǒ shì Xiǎo Míng.","en":"First meeting, I am Xiaoming."},{"sp":"小红","t":"初次见面，我是小红。","r":"chū cì jiàn miàn, wǒ shì Xiǎo Hóng.","en":"First meeting, I am Xiaohong."},{"sp":"小明","t":"很高兴认识你!","r":"hěn gāo xìng rèn shi nǐ!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我也是!","r":"wǒ yě shì!","en":"Me too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Xiaoming","answer":"我是小明"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"很高兴认识你"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you open with…","options":["你好","您好","再见","谢谢"],"answer":"您好"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 小明 / 我是","answer":"我是小明"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我是小明。","answer":"我是小明。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"初次见面 means…","options":["hello","first meeting","goodbye","thanks"],"answer":1,"why":"First-meeting phrase."},{"q":"很高兴认识你 means…","options":["thank you","nice to meet you","excuse me","good luck"],"answer":1,"why":"Happy-to-know-you."},{"q":"对不起 means…","options":["thanks","sorry","hello","yes"],"answer":1,"why":"对不起 = sorry."},{"q":"我也是 means…","options":["goodbye","me too","never","maybe"],"answer":1,"why":"我 + 也 = me-too."},{"q":"是 never…","options":["starts sentences","changes form","ends sentences","pairs with 不"],"answer":1,"why":"是 = am/is/are, frozen!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Greetings worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["hello","thanks","goodbye"],"key":["你好","谢谢","再见"]},{"instruction":"Introduce yourself.","items":["First meeting, I am Xiaoming","Nice to meet you"],"key":["初次见面，我是小明","很高兴认识你"]},{"instruction":"Dayparts.","items":["good morning","good evening"],"key":["早上好","晚上好"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U1-L2","title":"Names and 你叫什么","learn":"Ask names: 你叫什么名字? (what are you called?) → 我叫… How are you: 你好吗? → 我很好! 吗 makes questions, 呢 bounces back: 我很好，你呢? (I'm fine, and you?)!","vocab":[{"t":"我","r":"wǒ","en":"I / me","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"你","r":"nǐ","en":"you","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"名字","r":"míng zi","en":"name","pos":"noun"},{"t":"你叫什么名字","r":"nǐ jiào shén me míng zi","en":"what is your name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"我叫","r":"wǒ jiào","en":"I'm called","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"你好吗","r":"nǐ hǎo ma","en":"how are you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"请","r":"qǐng","en":"please","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"好","r":"hǎo","en":"good / fine","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"吗 asks, 呢 bounces","explain":"你好吗? (how are you?), 你叫什么? (what are you called?). 呢 = and…?: 你呢? = And you? 我叫小红，你呢?!","pattern":"…吗? → …。你呢?","examples":[{"t":"你好吗?","r":"nǐ hǎo ma?","en":"How are you?"},{"t":"我很好!","r":"wǒ hěn hǎo!","en":"I'm very fine!"},{"t":"你叫什么名字?","r":"nǐ jiào shén me míng zi?","en":"What is your name?"}],"mistakes":["Saying 我好吗 — ask OTHERS: 你好吗!","Forgetting 很: 我很好 (very-fine), not 我好!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你叫什么名字?","r":"nǐ jiào shén me míng zi?","en":"What is your name?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我叫小明。你好吗?","r":"wǒ jiào Xiǎo Míng. nǐ hǎo ma?","en":"I'm called Xiaoming. How are you?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我很好! 你呢?","r":"wǒ hěn hǎo! nǐ ne?","en":"I'm fine! And you?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我也很好!","r":"wǒ yě hěn hǎo!","en":"I'm fine too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How are you?","answer":"你好吗"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___好! (very)","answer":"很"},{"type":"choose","q":"呢 at the end…","options":["asks new question","bounces back (and you?)","commands","negates"],"answer":"bounces back (and you?)"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 吗 / 你好","answer":"你好吗"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 你好吗?","answer":"你好吗?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"你叫什么名字? asks…","options":["my name","your name","his name","no name"],"answer":1,"why":"叫什么 = called what."},{"q":"我很好 means…","options":["not well","I'm fine","so-so","busy"],"answer":1,"why":"很 + 好 = very-fine."},{"q":"你呢? means…","options":["who are you","and you?","where are you","why you"],"answer":1,"why":"呢 bounces back."},{"q":"吗 turns sentences into…","options":["orders","questions","past","negative"],"answer":1,"why":"好→好吗? = fine?/okay?."},{"q":"请 means…","options":["thanks","please","sorry","hello"],"answer":1,"why":"请 = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Questions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["I","you","name"],"key":["我","你","名字"]},{"instruction":"Ask with 吗.","items":["How are you?","What is your name?","And you?"],"key":["你好吗","你叫什么名字","你呢"]},{"instruction":"Answer.","items":["I'm fine!","Me too!"],"key":["我很好","我也是"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U2","title":"是 and measure words","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U2-L1","title":"是 and 这/那","learn":"Point! 这 (this), 那 (that). 这是书 = This is a book. Negative: 不是 (is not). Adjectives need 很: 很好 (very-good = good), 很大 (big)! 没有很 = sounds wrong!","vocab":[{"t":"这","r":"zhè","en":"this","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"那","r":"nà","en":"that","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"书","r":"shū","en":"book","pos":"noun"},{"t":"学校","r":"xué xiào","en":"school","pos":"noun"},{"t":"车","r":"chē","en":"car","pos":"noun"},{"t":"大","r":"dà","en":"big","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"小","r":"xiǎo","en":"small","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"人","r":"rén","en":"person","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"这是X · 不是 · 很 + adj","explain":"这是书 (this is a book), 那是学校 (that is a school). 不是书 (is not a book). 很大 (big), 很小 (small) — 很 required before adjectives!","pattern":"这/那 + 是 + X · 很 + adj","examples":[{"t":"这是书。","r":"zhè shì shū.","en":"This is a book."},{"t":"那是学校。","r":"nà shì xué xiào.","en":"That is a school."},{"t":"这不是书。","r":"zhè bú shì shū.","en":"This is not a book."}],"mistakes":["Saying 这书 — 是 required: 这是书!","Saying 大书 for 'big' — pair adjectives: 大书 ok, but predicate needs 很大!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"这是书吗?","r":"zhè shì shū ma?","en":"Is this a book?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"是，这是大书。","r":"shì, zhè shì dà shū.","en":"Yes, this is a big book."},{"sp":"小红","t":"那是学校吗?","r":"nà shì xué xiào ma?","en":"Is that a school?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"是!","r":"shì!","en":"Yes!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: This is a book","answer":"这是书"},{"type":"fill","q":"___是学校。 (That)","answer":"那"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This is not a book' is…","options":["这是书","这不是书","这是书吗","这没书"],"answer":"这不是书"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 书 / 这是","answer":"这是书"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 这是书。","answer":"这是书。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"那 points…","options":["near me","away (that)","nowhere","at me"],"answer":1,"why":"那 = that."},{"q":"不是 means…","options":["is","is not","was","will be"],"answer":1,"why":"不是 = is-not."},{"q":"很大 means…","options":["book big","big","my big","that big"],"answer":1,"why":"很 + 大 = big."},{"q":"Adjective predicates need…","options":["是","很","吗","呢"],"answer":1,"why":"很好 — 很 required!"},{"q":"车 means…","options":["school","car","book","house"],"answer":1,"why":"车 = car."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Pointing worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["this","that","book"],"key":["这","那","书"]},{"instruction":"Point and name.","items":["This is a book","That is a school","This is not a book"],"key":["这是书","那是学校","这不是书"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["Is this a book?","Yes!"],"key":["这是书吗","是"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U2-L2","title":"Measure words: 个/本","learn":"Count with MEASURE WORDS! 一个人 (one person), 三本书 (three books — 本 for books!), 两杯茶 (two cups of tea). Number + MW + noun — never skip the MW! 几 (how many, <10) vs 多少 (how many, any)!","vocab":[{"t":"一个","r":"yí ge","en":"one (thing)","pos":"number"},{"t":"两个","r":"liǎng ge","en":"two (things)","pos":"number"},{"t":"三个","r":"sān ge","en":"three (things)","pos":"number"},{"t":"一","r":"yī","en":"one","pos":"number"},{"t":"二","r":"èr","en":"two","pos":"number"},{"t":"三","r":"sān","en":"three","pos":"number"},{"t":"很多","r":"hěn duō","en":"many / a lot","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"一点","r":"yì diǎn","en":"a little","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Number + MW + noun","explain":"一个人 (one person), 两个苹果 (two apples), 三本书 (three books). 两 = two-before-MW (两个, not 二个)! 几个? = How many?","pattern":"number + 个/本/杯 + noun","examples":[{"t":"三个苹果，给我!","r":"sān ge píng guǒ, gěi wǒ!","en":"Three apples, please! (give me)"},{"t":"几个?","r":"jǐ ge?","en":"How many?"},{"t":"两个。","r":"liǎng ge.","en":"Two."}],"mistakes":["Saying 三书 — needs 三本书!","Saying 二个 — two-things: 两个!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"几个苹果?","r":"jǐ ge píng guǒ?","en":"How many apples?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"三个!","r":"sān ge!","en":"Three!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"三个苹果，给我!","r":"sān ge píng guǒ, gěi wǒ!","en":"Three apples, please!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"给你!","r":"gěi nǐ!","en":"Here you go!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Three apples, please","answer":"三个苹果，给我"},{"type":"fill","q":"___个? (How many?)","answer":"几"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Two things' is…","options":["二个","两个","两","二"],"answer":"两个"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 苹果 / 三个","answer":"三个苹果"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 三个苹果，给我!","answer":"三个苹果，给我!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"三本书 uses 本 because…","options":["apples","books' measure word","people","cups"],"answer":1,"why":"本 = MW for books."},{"q":"几个? asks…","options":["how much","how many","where","what"],"answer":1,"why":"几 = how many (<10)."},{"q":"两个 uses 两 because…","options":["formal","two-before-MW","plural","past"],"answer":1,"why":"两 replaces 二 before MWs."},{"q":"给你! means…","options":["goodbye","here you go","how many","please"],"answer":1,"why":"给你 = give-you!"},{"q":"多少 vs 几: the difference is…","options":["none","多少 = any size, 几 < 10","几 polite","多少 rude"],"answer":1,"why":"多少 for big/unknown counts."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Measure words worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["one (thing)","three (things)","many"],"key":["一个","三个","很多"]},{"instruction":"Count right.","items":["Three apples, please","How many?","Two"],"key":["三个苹果，给我","几个","两个"]},{"instruction":"Shop.","items":["Three, please!","Here you go!"],"key":["三个，给我","给你"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U3","title":"First verbs","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U3-L1","title":"Verbs never change: 吃","learn":"The BEST news: Chinese verbs NEVER conjugate! 我吃 (I eat), 你吃 (you eat), 他吃 (he eats) — same 吃! Negative: 不吃 (don't eat). Doing-now: 在吃 (am eating). Time words do everything!","vocab":[{"t":"吃","r":"chī","en":"to eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"喝","r":"hē","en":"to drink","pos":"verb"},{"t":"读","r":"dú","en":"to read","pos":"verb"},{"t":"写","r":"xiě","en":"to write","pos":"verb"},{"t":"说","r":"shuō","en":"to speak","pos":"verb"},{"t":"学习","r":"xué xí","en":"to study","pos":"verb"},{"t":"工作","r":"gōng zuò","en":"to work","pos":"verb"},{"t":"住","r":"zhù","en":"to live","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"No conjugation: 不 · 在 · 了","explain":"我吃面包 (I eat bread), 我不吃 (I don't eat), 我在吃 (I am eating), 我吃了 (I ate — 了 = completed)! Same verb, tiny helpers!","pattern":"verb · 不verb · 在verb · verb了","examples":[{"t":"我吃面包。","r":"wǒ chī miàn bāo.","en":"I eat bread."},{"t":"我说中文。","r":"wǒ shuō Zhōng wén.","en":"I speak Chinese."},{"t":"昨天我读了书。","r":"zuó tiān wǒ dú le shū.","en":"Yesterday I read a book."}],"mistakes":["Changing 吃 for he/she — verbs NEVER change!","Saying 不了 — completed-negative: 没吃 (didn't eat)!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你说英语吗?","r":"nǐ shuō Yīng yǔ ma?","en":"Do you speak English?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"说! 你呢?","r":"shuō! nǐ ne?","en":"Yes (speak)! And you?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我说中文!","r":"wǒ shuō Zhōng wén!","en":"I speak Chinese!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"厉害!","r":"lì hai!","en":"Awesome!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I eat bread","answer":"我吃面包"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___书。 (read)","answer":"读"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Yesterday I read a book' is…","options":["昨天我读书","昨天我读了书","昨天我不读书","明天我读了书"],"answer":"昨天我读了书"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 面包 / 我吃","answer":"我吃面包"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我吃面包。","answer":"我吃面包。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"不吃 means…","options":["eat","don't eat","ate","will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"不 = negative."},{"q":"吃了 means…","options":["eat","don't eat","ate","want eat"],"answer":2,"why":"了 = completed."},{"q":"说 means…","options":["to eat","to speak","to read","to write"],"answer":1,"why":"说 = to speak."},{"q":"Verbs change for…","options":["I/you/he","nothing — never","past only","plural"],"answer":1,"why":"Zero conjugation!"},{"q":"英语 means…","options":["Chinese","English","book","school"],"answer":1,"why":"英语 = English."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Verbs worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["to eat","to speak","to live"],"key":["吃","说","住"]},{"instruction":"不/在/了.","items":["I eat","I don't eat","I ate"],"key":["我吃","我不吃","我吃了"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["Do you speak English?","Awesome!"],"key":["你说英语吗","厉害"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U3-L2","title":"有 / 没有","learn":"HAVE = 有! 我有书 (I have a book). Don't-have = 没有 (NOT 不有!): 我没有钱 (I have no money). AT somewhere: 在: 我在家 (I'm at home). 是 = is, 在 = at, 有 = have — three pillars!","vocab":[{"t":"有","r":"yǒu","en":"to have","pos":"verb"},{"t":"没有","r":"méi yǒu","en":"don't have","pos":"verb"},{"t":"水","r":"shuǐ","en":"water","pos":"noun"},{"t":"家","r":"jiā","en":"home / family","pos":"noun"},{"t":"钱","r":"qián","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"朋友","r":"péng you","en":"friend","pos":"noun"},{"t":"时间","r":"shí jiān","en":"time","pos":"noun"},{"t":"面包","r":"miàn bāo","en":"bread","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"有/没有 · 在 (at)","explain":"我有书 (I have a book), 你有水吗? (do you have water?), 我没有钱 (no money). Location: 书在桌子上 (the book is on the table)!","pattern":"有/没有 + thing · 在 + place","examples":[{"t":"我有书。","r":"wǒ yǒu shū.","en":"I have a book."},{"t":"你有水吗?","r":"nǐ yǒu shuǐ ma?","en":"Do you have water?"},{"t":"我没有钱。","r":"wǒ méi yǒu qián.","en":"I have no money."}],"mistakes":["Saying 不有 — don't-have is 没有 (one word)!","Saying 我是在家 — at-home: 我在家 (no 是)!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"你有钱吗?","r":"nǐ yǒu qián ma?","en":"Do you have money?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"有! 也有面包!","r":"yǒu! yě yǒu miàn bāo!","en":"Yes! Bread too!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"谢谢! 你有朋友吗?","r":"xiè xie! nǐ yǒu péng you ma?","en":"Thanks! Do you have friends?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"有!","r":"yǒu!","en":"Yes!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have a book","answer":"我有书"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___钱。 (don't have)","answer":"没有"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Do you have water?' is…","options":["你喝水吗","你有水吗","你爱水吗","水在哪里"],"answer":"你有水吗"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 书 / 我有","answer":"我有书"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我有书。","answer":"我有书。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"我有书 means…","options":["I want a book","I have a book","I read a book","I see a book"],"answer":1,"why":"有 = have."},{"q":"没有 means…","options":["have","don't have","want","see"],"answer":1,"why":"没有 = not-have."},{"q":"在家 means…","options":["my home","at home","go home","big home"],"answer":1,"why":"在 = at."},{"q":"朋友 means…","options":["book","friend","money","time"],"answer":1,"why":"朋友 = friend."},{"q":"面包 means…","options":["water","bread","rice","noodles"],"answer":1,"why":"面包 = bread."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"有 worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["to have","don't have","money"],"key":["有","没有","钱"]},{"instruction":"Have or not.","items":["I have a book","Do you have water?","I have no money"],"key":["我有书","你有水吗","我没有钱"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["Do you have money?","Yes!"],"key":["你有钱吗","有"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Xiaoming","answer":"我是小明"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"很高兴认识你"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you open with…","options":["你好","您好","再见","谢谢"],"answer":"您好"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I eat bread","answer":"我吃面包"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"我有书。","answer":"I have a book."},{"type":"fill","q":"___是学校。 (That)","answer":"那"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 吗 / 你好","answer":"你好吗"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我吃面包。","answer":"我吃面包。"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___钱。 (don't have)","answer":"没有"},{"type":"choose","q":"昨天我读了书。","options":["I read books","Yesterday I read a book","I will read","I don't read"],"answer":"Yesterday I read a book"}]}}}